00:38:20.960 --> 00:38:28.560
Like, it just seems like it's designed, the levels seem designed really well for a different character that moves differently.

00:38:29.160 --> 00:38:38.280
Minus a couple of things we talked about, like those cannons that just shoot air at you, like, that feel like an afterthought, like just to make it artificially more difficult.

00:38:38.880 --> 00:38:51.160
But, like, there's a lot of charm to the mechanics that, like, could be seen if you dig beneath the terrible movement and, like, the weird screen scrolling.

00:38:51.660 --> 00:39:04.120
So, like, I think that, like, a lot of this, naturally, we were talking about, like, what you could do to make it so you can go as fast as they want you to.

00:39:04.260 --> 00:39:05.760
